  silvercode debug config        show resolved configuration
  silvercode debug lsp           LSP debugging utilities
  silvercode debug rg            ripgrep debugging utilities
  silvercode debug file          file system debugging utilities
  silvercode debug scrap         list all known projects
  silvercode debug skill         list all available skills
  silvercode debug snapshot      snapshot debugging utilities
  silvercode debug startup       print startup timing
  silvercode debug agent <name>  show agent configuration details
  silvercode debug v2            debug v2 catalog and built-in plugins
  silvercode debug info          show debug information
  silvercode debug paths         show global paths (data, config, cache, state)
